+
+# 2026-10-10-plugin-task-sessions
+
+English | [中文](2026-10-10-plugin-task-sessions.zh.md)
+
+## Summary
+
+Adds an ignorable log-only event for confirmed plugin task sessions.
+
+## Table of Contents
+
+- [Declaration](#declaration)
+- [Compatibility](#compatibility)
+- [Verification](#verification)
+- [Dev Note](#dev-note)
+
+<a id="declaration"></a>
+## Declaration
+
+```yaml persistence-change
+schemaVersion: 1
+id: 2026-10-10-plugin-task-sessions
+baseline: false
+changes:
+  - root: "event:session/plugin-task-bound"
+    previous: null
+    after: "cb630a610a5513a52a72399499e60d20c168cdb509a2505d81ccec17f404e2f8"
+    decision: same-version
+```
+
+<a id="compatibility"></a>
+## Compatibility
+
+Session format remains v4. Every producer sets ignorable=true, so older readers can skip the task event. Existing session/title events and their provider and user sources are unchanged. Session list metadata adds an optional task activity time and upgrades its cache fold.
+
+<a id="verification"></a>
+## Verification
+
+161 focused session, title and projection tests and 32 search/task tests pass; host build succeeds. Packaged old-reader and restart checks are recorded separately.
+
+<a id="dev-note"></a>
+## Dev Note
+
+None.
