+# Session V4 persistence format
+
+English | [中文](v4.zh.md)
+
+Captured from the official dsh-v0.2.0-rc.2 tag before the local V5 repair. V4 provider titles require human message references; user titles cite none. The frozen V3-to-V4 package owns native V4 admission and physical row encoding. This reference describes the released schema; it does not relax migration validation.
