 ## Durable title state
 
-`SessionTitleProviderId` is recorded for provider-produced revisions. `SessionTitleEventData` lists the exact human-message seqs used for the title, while `SessionTitleSnapshot` adds the durable event envelope facts returned by `ctx.sessionTitle.get()` and `foldSessionTitle()`. The `title` projection keeps its version-1 state and client view as only the title string or `null`, so existing persisted cache rows remain readable.
+`SessionTitleProviderId` is recorded for provider-produced revisions. `SessionTitleEventData` lists the exact supporting human-message seqs, or an empty list for a manual rename or registered task title. `TaskTitleOwner` links a task title to its strictly earlier matching registration. `SessionTitleSnapshot` adds the durable event envelope facts returned by `ctx.sessionTitle.get()` and `foldSessionTitle()`. The `title` projection keeps its version-1 state and client view as only the title string or `null`, so existing persisted cache rows remain readable.
