+`PluginTaskBinding` names a confirmed plugin, workspace, Session, project and task. The host's `PluginTaskProvider` validates those identities and supplies the current confirmed title before `sessionTasks.bind` records `session/plugin-task-bound`. This log-only event contributes no model message or execution turn. Ordinary unconfirmed Sessions remain provisional.
+
